{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_16_level_main_16-18_end","groupId":"main_16","stageId":"main_16-17","title":"紅日留駐","storyCode":"16-18","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_16-18_end.txt","sourceHash":"4914db81ac9b6285a18711a3567c19438dbb0bcbe6fae32571dfac8af6f36c38","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在撤離行動中，即使知道車輛就在前方，一些礦工還是為了引開火力而選擇了舉起火把往回走。眼看越來越多人死於轟炸，阿米婭舉劍在冰上劃出了一道火牆，阻擋住了集團軍的炮火。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"“這裡是調度中心。”\n“目標已鎖定，正在向涅瓦湖方向移動。”\n“各單位暫停炮火打擊，依計劃包圍座標位置。”\n“座標已傳送至終端。”\n……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_newiceforest_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Raidian，你們成功穿越樹林了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"先遣隊已經到達會合地點。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"第一批接應的車輛到了，等待後續車輛抵達還需要一點時間。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，事先沒有料想到會是這麼緊急的狀況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Raidian，你有偵測到集團軍後續的動向嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還沒有……自從我們發出全域廣播後，集團軍的軍用頻段就沉默了。他們應該已經有所防範，我們暫時無法掌握集團軍的更多動向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡太安靜了，反而讓人有點不安……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，你們一定要注意隱藏行蹤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了，我們會小心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好，保持聯絡。Mantra的情況怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mantra女士還處於脫力狀態，精神也尚未恢復。別喬克他們幫忙做了一個簡易擔架——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mantra女士！請您不要繼續“說話”了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我已經清醒了。請告訴極境，我能站起來自己行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，您不可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我就說還不可以！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Mantra，記得上次煌因為任務受傷必須在床上靜養半個月的時候嗎？我們甚至都沒讓她的腳尖碰地超過一秒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在，你也別想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……情況不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔。或者各退一步吧，等你們順利穿越樹林，你在我和極境當中選一個當你的拐杖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走過去，穿越結冰的，湖面，前面就是……聖駿堡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說，感染者……都不能進入，移動城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還沒感染的時候，我也沒去過移動城市。進礦區之前我都待在村子裡，直到天災降臨，把大部分的村民都變成了感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過那些人不是說不需要我們自己走過去嗎？不是會有車來接我們，就像我們之前找到的那些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得尼克托那個小子就是從聖駿堡來的，只可惜他現在不在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“小枝條”，你覺得尼克托和雷爾金他們現在正在做什麼呢？他們走得比較早，會不會已經到那個什麼農莊了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也、也許……有可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望，是這樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……所有人，馬上就近尋找掩體臥倒！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"轟炸——在樹林那邊！集團軍抵達了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我探測到了……就在剛剛，又有一支軍隊從東面發動突襲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們好像掌握了我們的位置……他們準備把我們往涅瓦湖的方向驅趕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們瘋了！這裡已經是中央區的地界，集團軍不可能不清楚這代表什麼！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“聖駿堡的安全受到威脅……集團軍……即將消滅敵人。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是公開廣播，他們還在向聖駿堡傳送訊號，聲稱這是剿滅叛亂的行動！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不……不不不……哈……原來，原來是這樣……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"屠殺、驅趕……集團軍就是打著鎮壓叛亂的名義陳兵聖駿堡城下，用炮口對準聖駿堡的城門，再去跟議會談判！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是他們的目的……這就是他們用遠北幾十萬人的性命，想要達成的結果。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，聽得到嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你們東側有集團軍的部隊，小心躲避——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……磁暴帶來的影響太強烈了，這個距離沒有辦法建立穩定的通訊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿洛伊澤，大部隊的人很快就會到達，我需要你留在這裡指揮大家依序上車撤離。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，那您呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必須回去，為他們指引撤離的方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要把我和這些撤離的車留在一起？你就不怕我丟下你們自己逃回聖駿堡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果那是你最終的決定，我也希望你可以提前通知我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島會另想辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵……那個叫羅德島的地方，裡面的人都跟你一樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……他們都是比我還要勇敢的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的指揮就交給你了，“中士”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_newiceforest_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在追我們的到底是什麼東西？簡直像是憑空出現——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（踉蹌）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"集團軍在無差別轟炸，我們是不是換一條路比較好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"極境先生，你可以聯絡到Raidian嗎？先遣隊的處境可能會比我們更加危險！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭！你們在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們還在涅瓦湖東岸的樹林裡！我們正在遭受集團軍的炮火攻擊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"集團軍在東邊增派了部隊，我們現在只能儘快穿過涅瓦湖！穿過涅瓦湖……就到聖駿堡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"集團軍未經允許不能踏上涅瓦湖西岸的土地，這是他們最後的底線，也是我們現在唯一的生路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，無論如何，我們必須趕在集團軍徹底合圍之前儘快穿過涅瓦湖——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Raidian？Raidian？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"磁暴——通訊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——向西南——冰面——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g8_farnorthtundra_aurora"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請大家不要使用任何照明設備，我們只能摸黑前進，儘快穿過冰面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一直向西南……我會為大家指引方向的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白。看著星星，有方向——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"零星的炮彈開始像驚雷一樣砸下，而後在人群中央炸開。破片四散，巨大的衝擊將原本聚集的隊伍輕易撕裂成兩半。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢揚叔叔——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"橫亙在中間的，是開裂的冰面與那些來不及反應而墜落其中的同伴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"冰面還在開裂——我們過不去了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先往另一邊跑！不要過來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，他們越來越近了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"極境先生，聯絡到Raidian了嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊伍被打散了，現在有一些落單的礦工需要接應，就在剛才炮彈落下位置的西北方——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"收到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我正在趕過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——嗚……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"達雅，你的腿上，有血……我幫你，止血！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來幫忙——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……不。別喬克，就把我丟在這裡吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我身上還有打火石。你留根乾柴給我，然後快走。我幫你們引開那些傢伙，至少還能多拖一陣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"達雅，我扶著你。我可以，扶著你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要……不要放棄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，不要放棄！血馬上就能止住了，等上車之後，我們就能幫你進一步包紮——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但那些不停丟出源石炸彈的傢伙不會等！他們正在把我們當野生的裂獸一樣驅趕，你們難道都沒有發現嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果只是為了殺死我們，那把經過的所有地方都點燃、都炸成廢墟，也能達成目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不信他們沒有這樣的能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……但這不是我們應該放棄的理由……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不瞭解。還沒被丟進礦井之前，我是個獵戶，我知道城裡那些人最喜歡什麼樣的狩獵遊戲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們最喜歡把獵物驅趕到一起，先打死一兩隻，然後觀賞剩下的獵物在包圍網內激烈地反抗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說真的，我甚至都不確定自己能不能至少引開他們一下下，但我得試試看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是腿上被炸了個洞，沒什麼大不了的，就算往東邊爬，我也能爬個幾十公尺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以別再浪費時間了，把乾柴留下，你們……快走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快點！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"擔憂的幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請大家依序上車！我們會在這裡停留十五分鐘，不必——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"擔憂的幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——推擠……"},{"type":"narration","text":"幹員的聲音突然變小了，因為她發現隊伍既沒有推擠，也不混亂。\n人群只是沉默著，不斷前進。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我得說，我從來都沒有看過這麼安靜、有秩序的撤離行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"連以治軍嚴苛聞名的第一集團軍可能都做不到這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"擔憂的幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1560_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是好事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是有點反常，不是嗎？就好像他們的求生本能都被關閉了一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，也可能是我想太多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的隊長還在最後面收尾，你不擔心嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"擔憂的幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1560_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長是我們當中救援經驗最豐富的。"},{"type":"narration","text":"幹員踮起腳抬頭，視線越過與漆黑冰面融為一體的人群，嘗試尋找隊長的身影。\n但她看到的只有最遠處那抹刺目的紅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"擔憂的幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1560_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道他們真的停在了那裡……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"敵人開始轟炸冰面了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我聯絡不到駕駛員，需要附近的人去通知她把車輛保持啟動狀態，以便隨時撤離。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"收到請回覆！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"擔憂的幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1560_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收、收到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"擔憂的幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1560_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿洛伊澤小姐，請您先上車吧，這裡有我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你先上去，幫你的隊長跟駕駛員溝通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我留在這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"轉移了近衛軍注意的是一簇火。\n起先只是一簇，站在隊伍最後的某個人舉起的火。\n沒有人聽到他是否說了什麼，也沒有人知道他為什麼要這樣做。那個人似乎只是停下腳步，舉起火，然後開始往回走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"誰點火的？不是說不能照明——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是基安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"基安？以前幫大家做打火石的基安？他剛才還把乾木柴拿給達雅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是他。他在往回走，但東邊都是軍隊！難道他也要去送死？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他要做和達雅一樣的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我們明明馬上就能得救——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也有打火石，我也有乾木柴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你要做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"冰面被轟炸了，他們不會放過我們。如果什麼也不做，這樣下去……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒有人可以活下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我想活下來，我想去聖駿堡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們本來會死在礦區裡的，記得嗎？和烏薩斯所有的感染者一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果我們現在能讓最前面的其他同伴，讓那些來救我們的年輕人活下去……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就會有人記得這裡發生了什麼，比我們這些老傢伙記得更久、更清楚。"},{"type":"narration","text":"火從一支火把的頂端，傳遞到另一支火把的頂端。\n一個人放棄了生路，接著是第二個、第三個、第四個……\n越來越多還沒上車的礦工舉起火，開始往回走去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他們走向基安，走向達雅，走向所有被拋在身後的腳印，也走向那越來越逼近的威脅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們……不能再……掩埋……我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，他們不能再悄無聲息地掩埋我們，無論是埋在雪裡，還是埋在礦井裡、湖水裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們從兄弟姐妹手中取走火，點起光，照亮路……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們在這裡，是要讓整個烏薩斯都看見——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看見我們曾經活過。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"主動選擇殿後的礦工們，在寒夜中一個接著一個舉起火把。\n他們選擇暴露自己的位置，在冰面上形成一條清晰而穩定的火帶。\n“烏薩斯無法將今夜像往常一樣掩埋。”他們這樣堅信。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"而在這道火光的盡頭，紅色的眼睛並未停止注視。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g8_farnorthtundra_aurora"},{"type":"narration","text":"轟炸仍在持續，冰面仍在開裂，不斷有人從那些歙張的大口中墜落。\n直到被吞沒的最後一刻，他們都高喊著舉起手中燃燒的火把，只有聲音中微不可聞的顫抖，洩露了他們的恐懼。\n不可能不害怕，不可能不畏縮。\n但他們還是高舉著火，試圖用自己的死，為身後的人換一條生路。\n即使羅德島眾人試圖阻止，也沒有一個人聽從。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，轟炸還在持續！阿洛伊澤那邊的車已經載滿人了，等待後續車輛抵達還需要時間——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼……他們為什麼要這麼做……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們得繼續阻止他們，不能這樣下去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在的能力無法阻攔這麼多人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是阿米婭，這裡一定有我們能做到的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mantra女士……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能感覺到，我能感覺到他們……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的……憤怒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這份情感太強大了，就好像他們自己都快被這股憤怒燒成灰燼一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不可以……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可以再這樣下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"必須——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"必須停止這場屠殺！"},{"type":"narration","text":"憤怒，相似的憤怒。\n這是阿米婭一直以來都在努力克制的情緒，這是她永遠不會放任的情緒。\n憤怒如同眼中的星火一樣點燃了阿米婭的心臟，流向她的指尖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“即使我不報復也不懷恨，我也有永遠憤怒下去的權利！”\n青與黑的長劍，怒火打磨的長劍，如願再度出現在她手中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g8_farnorthtundra_aurora"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"影霄——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i24"},{"type":"narration","text":"隨著揮劍的動作，青色的火焰自劍鋒處迸發而出，高度凝結的能量束瞬間就在冰上劃出一道火牆，同時也是一條漫長而明確的分界線。\n一側，是裂痕正在擴散的冰面和被擋在火牆之外的炮彈。\n另一側，是渺小的卡特斯與手舉火焰的感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們……"},{"type":"narration","text":"而後，阿米婭將劍指向對岸，指向那將人如牲畜般驅趕與殺戮的源頭——集團軍。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“在此停下。”\n劍鋒閃爍，青焰升騰，她以此告誡製造屠殺的劊子手，無論是炮火、士兵，還是軍艦本身，在怒火消弭、背棄都得到清算前……\n他們將永遠無法跨越這條界線。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"“報告，前方偵測到來源不明的高能量源石反應。”\n“……謹慎觀察，暫緩推進。”\n“收到。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g8_farnorthtundra_aurora"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"……他們要停火了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，轟炸還在持續，只是頻率降低了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，你已經成功擋住了部分攻擊，請儘快歸隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"支援的車輛應該很快就要到達了，準備撤離！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我留在最後，等所有人都離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下……有新的情況！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"西邊好像有車輛正在向我們加速駛來，但那不是我們的車——好像是卡車！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"他們直接開上了冰面！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"全體戒備——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Raidian！這個東西終於派上用場了，是我們！我和博士，還有科謝尼婭——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"還有柳德米拉。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"還有幹員弒君者。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"羅德島……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"準備集合。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士！Mon3tr！你們怎麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且幹員弒君者……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弒君者","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趕路的時候沒時間閒聊，我也有很多問題想問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弒君者","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在，先上車。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"託卡車互助會的福。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"之後再告訴你。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"大家都還好嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會讓你失望。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還好。可以之後再慢慢敘舊，我們必須儘快撤離了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"對。總之，幹員Mon3tr、幹員弒君者……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"以及{@nickname}，歸隊。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"涅瓦湖西南岸崗哨的所有監視器光束，在快速掃過冰面上的倖存者之後，指向對岸的集團軍。\n白光散射，與紅光無聲對峙，而後，轟炸的頻率再度降低。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“各單位注意，這裡是調度中心。”\n“根據聖駿堡緊急電報要求，各單位立即停火。”\n“重複，各單位立即停火。”\n“收到請回覆。”\n“……”\n“……”\n“……”\n“收到。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"這次好像是……真的停止了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，全員都歸隊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"是的……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"看來，我們都趕上了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_401_elysm","aliases":["極境"]}]}
